+
+/* "What would you have done?" (Task 7, #70, spec section 4.4): the puzzle
+   table, the action controls, and the reveal. Generated pages under
+   site/wwyhd/ reach for these names; the controller at site/wwyhd.js adds
+   the two state classes (.wwyhd-seat--acting, .wwyhd-differs) as the hand
+   goes.
+
+   Nothing below reaches for the lime custom property. The one primary call
