+
+/* One card, in the two-character notation the whole feature uses. Monospace
+   so a board of five lines up as a set, the same reason .stat is. */
+.wwyhd-card {
+  display: inline-block; margin-right: .3em; padding: .15em .5em;
+  font-family: "SF Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
+  border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: #fff;
+}
+/* A holding the visitor cannot see. Parchment and muted, so it reads as an
